NAME
     wc - count lines, words and bytes

SYNOPSIS
     wc [-l] [-w] [-c] [-m] [FILE...]

DESCRIPTION
     wc counts in each FILE, or in standard input, and prints a total
     line when there is more than one file. With no options it prints
     lines, words and bytes.

OPTIONS
     -l   lines
     -w   words
     -c   bytes
     -m   characters

SEE ALSO
     cat(1), grep(1)
